<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Black Belt Bytes · How It Works</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap">
<style>
@font-face{font-family:'BBB Cisco Sans';font-weight:400;src:local('CiscoSansTT'),local('CiscoSansTT Regular'),local('CiscoSans'),local('Cisco Sans'),local('CiscoSans-Regular');}
:root{
  --font:'BBB Cisco Sans','CiscoSansTT','CiscoSans','Inter',Arial,sans-serif;
  --navy:#07182D; --navy2:#0F2744; --line:#1E3654; --cyan:#00BCEB; --pale:#B7C4D1; --dim:#8A9BAD; --white:#fff;
  --blue:#1D63C6; --teal:#0E7C8A; --purple:#7A3FB8; --orange:#C2570C; --green:#2E8540;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
html,body{height:100%;background:var(--navy);overflow:hidden}
body{font-family:var(--font);font-weight:400;color:#fff;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
button{font-family:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer}

/* stage scales to fit any screen */
.stage{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:1600px;height:900px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(var(--s,1));overflow:hidden;
  background:radial-gradient(520px 520px at 1720px 80px,rgba(0,188,235,.55),transparent 70%),
             radial-gradient(520px 520px at 1760px 470px,rgba(235,20,125,.45),transparent 70%),
             radial-gradient(520px 520px at 1720px 900px,rgba(255,138,0,.45),transparent 70%),
             var(--navy)}
.stage::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.06) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:22px 22px;pointer-events:none}

.scene{position:absolute;inset:0;padding:64px 80px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .5s,visibility .5s}
.scene.active{opacity:1;visibility:visible}
.scene:not(.s1){display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:40px 80px 96px}
.a{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .6s ease,transform .6s ease}
.scene.active .a{opacity:1;transform:none;transition-delay:calc(var(--d,0)*1ms)}

.kicker{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--cyan)}
h2{font-weight:400;font-size:52px;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-top:10px}
.lede{font-size:19px;color:var(--pale);margin-top:12px;max-width:900px;line-height:1.5}
.card{background:var(--navy2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px}
.chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border:1px solid var(--line);color:#fff}
.chip.cy{background:var(--cyan);border-color:var(--cyan);color:var(--navy)}
svg.i{width:22px;height:22px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}

/* chrome */
.foot{position:absolute;left:80px;right:80px;bottom:26px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;color:var(--dim);z-index:5}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.dots{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-right:10px}
.dots button{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:99px;border:0;background:#2A4466;padding:0;transition:all .3s}
.dots button.on{width:28px;background:var(--cyan)}
.nbtn{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--navy2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.nbtn:hover{border-color:var(--cyan)}
.bar{position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;height:3px;background:var(--cyan);transition:width .5s;z-index:5}

/* ---------- 1 title ---------- */
.s1 .logo{width:150px}
.s1 .t{position:absolute;left:80px;top:270px}
.s1 h1{font-weight:400;font-size:104px;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1;margin-top:16px}
.s1 .sub{font-size:28px;color:var(--pale);margin-top:22px;max-width:780px;line-height:1.35}
.s1 .badge{position:absolute;right:190px;top:250px;width:300px;height:300px;background:#fff;border-radius:34px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.45);animation:float 6s ease-in-out infinite}
.s1 .badge img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}
@keyframes float{50%{transform:translateY(-10px)}}
.s1 .pres{position:absolute;left:80px;bottom:90px;font-size:17px;color:var(--pale)}
.s1 .pres span{color:var(--dim);margin-right:10px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase}

/* ---------- 2 problem ---------- */
.s2 .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:22px;margin-top:54px}
.s2 .p{padding:34px;min-height:300px}
.s2 .p .ic{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:99px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;margin-bottom:24px}
.s2 .p b{display:block;font-weight:400;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:12px}
.s2 .p span{font-size:20px;color:var(--pale);line-height:1.5}
.s2 .goal{margin-top:28px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;padding:32px 34px;border-radius:18px;background:var(--cyan);color:var(--navy)}
.s2 .goal .k{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap}
.s2 .goal p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35}

/* ---------- 3 pipeline ---------- */
.track{position:relative;margin-top:56px;height:150px}
.track svg.line{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:150px;overflow:visible}
.track .ln{stroke:var(--line);stroke-width:3;fill:none}
.track .lp{stroke:var(--cyan);stroke-width:3;fill:none;transition:stroke-dashoffset .9s ease}
.nodes{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 40px}
.node{background:none;border:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:180px;padding:0}
.node .c{width:78px;height:78px;border-radius:99px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--navy2);border:2px solid var(--line);color:var(--pale);transition:all .4s;position:relative}
.node .c svg{width:30px;height:30px}
.node .n{font-size:23px;color:var(--pale);transition:color .4s}
.node.done .c{border-color:var(--cyan);color:var(--cyan)}
.node.on .c{background:var(--col);border-color:var(--col);color:#fff;transform:scale(1.12);box-shadow:0 0 0 10px color-mix(in srgb,var(--col) 25%,transparent)}
.node.on .n,.node.done .n{color:#fff}
.token{position:absolute;top:-34px;left:0;transform:translateX(-50%);transition:left .9s cubic-bezier(.6,.05,.3,1);pointer-events:none}
.token span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:13px;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--cyan);color:var(--navy);white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,188,235,.45)}
.loopline{position:absolute;left:115px;right:115px;top:118px;height:44px;border:2px dashed #2A4466;border-top:0;border-radius:0 0 30px 30px}
.loopline i{position:absolute;bottom:-12px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);font-style:normal;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);background:var(--navy);padding:0 12px}
.detail{margin-top:64px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:360px 1fr 300px;gap:0;padding:0;overflow:hidden;min-height:290px}
.detail > div{padding:36px 36px}
.detail .hd{border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.detail .hd .num{font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--cyan)}
.detail .hd h3{font-weight:400;font-size:42px;margin:8px 0 14px}
.detail ul{list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
.detail li{display:flex;gap:12px;font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;color:#E4EAF0}
.detail li::before{content:"";width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--cyan);margin-top:9px;flex:none}
.detail .out{border-left:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(0,188,235,.06)}
.detail .lab{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:10px}
.detail .outv{font-size:27px;line-height:1.3}
.swap{animation:swap .45s ease}
@keyframes swap{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)}}

/* ---------- 4 descript ---------- */
.s4 .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:900px 1fr;gap:34px;margin-top:40px}
.mock{border-radius:18px;background:#0B1F38;border:1px solid var(--line);overflow:hidden}
.mock .top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px;color:var(--pale)}
.mock .top i{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:99px;display:inline-block}
.mock .top b{font-weight:400;margin-left:12px}
.mock .body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:520px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:18px}
.prev{position:relative;height:300px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0F2744,#13345E);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden}
.prev .pl{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.prev .flash{position:absolute;inset:0;background:#fff;opacity:0}
.mock.s3 .prev .flash{animation:flash 1.6s ease 1}
@keyframes flash{0%,100%{opacity:0}8%{opacity:.85}30%{opacity:0}45%{opacity:.6}60%{opacity:0}}
.prev .ready{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;background:rgba(7,24,45,.75);font-size:22px;color:var(--cyan);opacity:0;transition:opacity .4s}
.mock.s6 .prev .ready{opacity:1;transition-delay:1.5s}
.script{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.script .lab{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}
.sl{font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.4;padding:9px 11px;border-radius:9px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);position:relative;min-height:56px}
.sl .old{color:var(--pale);transition:all .4s}
.sl .new{position:absolute;inset:9px 11px;color:#fff;opacity:0;transition:opacity .5s}
.mock.s4 .sl .old{opacity:0}
.mock.s4 .sl .new{opacity:1}
.mock.s4 .sl{background:rgba(0,188,235,.1);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,188,235,.4)}
.mock.s4 .sl:nth-child(3) .new{transition-delay:.3s}.mock.s4 .sl:nth-child(4) .new{transition-delay:.6s}
.tl{padding:0 18px 12px}
.tl .lab{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:8px}
.segs{display:flex;gap:4px;height:48px}
.seg{flex:1;border-radius:6px;background:var(--blue);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .5s,flex .6s,background .5s,opacity .5s}
.mock.s1 .seg{transform:scaleX(1)}
.seg:nth-child(odd){background:#2B74D6}
.mock.s2 .seg.cut{flex:.18;background:#3A4B60;opacity:.45}
.marks{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--cyan);opacity:0;transition:opacity .4s}
.mock.s2 .marks{opacity:1}
.thumbs{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;height:56px}
.thumbs i{flex:1;border-radius:7px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1C3B66,#245089);opacity:0;transform:scale(.6);transition:all .35s}
.mock.s3 .thumbs i{opacity:1;transform:none}
.mock.s3 .thumbs i:nth-child(2){transition-delay:.15s}.mock.s3 .thumbs i:nth-child(3){transition-delay:.3s}.mock.s3 .thumbs i:nth-child(4){transition-delay:.45s}.mock.s3 .thumbs i:nth-child(5){transition-delay:.6s}
.wave{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;height:40px;margin-top:12px}
.wave i{flex:1;height:4px;border-radius:3px;background:#2A4466;transition:background .3s}
.mock.s5 .wave i{background:var(--cyan);animation:wv .9s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
@keyframes wv{from{height:4px}to{height:var(--h)}}
.render{height:6px;border-radius:99px;background:#1E3654;margin:12px 0 4px;overflow:hidden}
.render i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:var(--cyan);transition:width 1.5s ease}
.mock.s6 .render i{width:100%}

.steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.st{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;padding:15px 20px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid transparent;transition:all .35s}
.st .k{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:99px;flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;background:var(--navy2);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--pale);transition:all .35s}
.st b{display:block;font-weight:400;font-size:22px;color:var(--pale);transition:color .35s}
.st span{display:block;font-size:16px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:3px}
.st s{display:block;font-size:13.5px;color:#5E7088;margin-top:4px}
.st.on{background:var(--navy2);border-color:var(--cyan)}
.st.on .k,.st.done .k{background:var(--cyan);border-color:var(--cyan);color:var(--navy)}
.st.on b,.st.done b{color:#fff}
.st.on span{color:var(--pale)}

/* ---------- 5 learner ---------- */
.flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:28px;margin-top:56px}
.fs{position:relative}
.fs .shot{height:270px;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;transition:all .4s}
.fs .shot img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top}
.fs .shot.bb{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:28px}
.fs .shot.bb img{object-fit:contain}
.fs .n{position:absolute;left:-12px;top:-14px;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--navy2);border:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:15px;z-index:2;transition:all .4s}
.fs b{display:block;font-weight:400;font-size:24px;margin-top:22px}
.fs span{display:block;font-size:18px;color:var(--pale);margin-top:8px;line-height:1.45}
.fs.on .shot{border-color:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(0,188,235,.35),0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.4);transform:translateY(-6px)}
.fs.on .n{background:var(--cyan);border-color:var(--cyan);color:var(--navy)}
.fs .arr{position:absolute;right:-24px;top:122px;color:var(--cyan);z-index:3}
.note{margin-top:56px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-size:21px;color:var(--pale)}
.note b{font-weight:400;color:#fff}


/* ---------- 5 learner (live demo) ---------- */
.lx{display:grid;grid-template-columns:900px 1fr;gap:34px;margin-top:34px;align-items:start}
.browser{border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#0B1F38;box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}
.bbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.bbar i{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:99px;display:inline-block}
.url{flex:1;margin:0 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:30px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);font-size:13px;color:var(--pale)}
.url svg{width:14px;height:14px}
.tryit{height:30px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid var(--cyan);background:transparent;color:var(--cyan);font-size:13px}
.tryit.on{background:var(--cyan);color:var(--navy)}
.view{position:relative;width:900px;height:563px;overflow:hidden;background:#F3F5F8}
.view iframe{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:1440px;height:900px;border:0;transform:scale(.625);transform-origin:0 0}
.shield{position:absolute;inset:0}
.view.live .shield,.view.live .cursor,.view.live .tip{display:none}
.cursor{position:absolute;left:520px;top:420px;width:30px;height:30px;transition:left .85s cubic-bezier(.5,.05,.25,1),top .85s cubic-bezier(.5,.05,.25,1);z-index:3;filter:drop-shadow(0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.35))}
.cursor svg{position:relative;z-index:2}
.ripple{position:absolute;left:-14px;top:-14px;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:99px;border:3px solid var(--cyan);opacity:0}
.cursor.click .ripple{animation:rip .6s ease-out}
@keyframes rip{0%{opacity:1;transform:scale(.3)}100%{opacity:0;transform:scale(1.8)}}
.tip{position:absolute;z-index:4;max-width:300px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-size:15px;line-height:1.35;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35);opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px);transition:opacity .35s,transform .35s;pointer-events:none}
.tip.show{opacity:1;transform:none}
.tip b{font-weight:400;color:var(--cyan)}
.lsteps .clicks{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--navy2);border:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:16px}
.lsteps .clicks span{font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}
.lsteps .clicks div{display:flex;gap:8px}
.lsteps .clicks i{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:99px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-style:normal;font-size:15px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--dim);transition:all .3s}
.lsteps .clicks i.on{background:var(--cyan);border-color:var(--cyan);color:var(--navy);transform:scale(1.08)}
.lsteps ol{list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.lsteps li{display:flex;gap:14px;padding:13px 16px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid transparent;transition:all .35s}
.lsteps li .k{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:99px;flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;background:var(--navy2);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--pale);transition:all .35s}
.lsteps li b{display:block;font-weight:400;font-size:20px;color:var(--pale);transition:color .35s}
.lsteps li span{display:block;font-size:15px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:3px;line-height:1.4}
.lsteps li em{font-style:normal;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--cyan);margin-left:8px;vertical-align:middle}
.lsteps li.on{background:var(--navy2);border-color:var(--cyan)}
.lsteps li.on .k,.lsteps li.done .k{background:var(--cyan);border-color:var(--cyan);color:var(--navy)}
.lsteps li.on b,.lsteps li.done b{color:#fff}
.lsteps li.on span{color:var(--pale)}

/* ---------- 6 plan ---------- */
.s6 .g{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:22px;margin-top:44px}
.ph{padding:32px;position:relative;min-height:300px}
.ph .k{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--cyan)}
.ph h3{font-weight:400;font-size:33px;margin:10px 0 12px}
.ph p{font-size:19.5px;color:var(--pale);line-height:1.5}
.ph .cap{position:absolute;left:32px;right:32px;bottom:28px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:21px;color:var(--cyan)}
.ph.hl{border-color:var(--cyan)}
.s6 .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr;gap:22px;margin-top:22px}
.team .p b{white-space:nowrap}
.team{padding:28px 30px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}
.team .p{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.team .av{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:99px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:15px;background:var(--blue)}
.team .av.id{background:var(--cyan);color:var(--navy)}
.team .p b{display:block;font-weight:400;font-size:18px}
.team .p small{font-size:14px;color:var(--dim)}
.ask{padding:24px 28px;background:var(--cyan);color:var(--navy);border-radius:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px}
.ask .k{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase}
.ask p{font-size:22px;line-height:1.35;margin-top:4px}
.count{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px}
.count b{font-weight:400;font-size:64px;color:var(--cyan);line-height:1}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="stage" id="stage">

  <!-- 1 -->
  <section class="scene s1" aria-label="Title">
    <img class="logo a" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Cisco">
    <div class="t">
      <div class="kicker a" style="--d:150">Cisco Black Belt Academy</div>
      <h1 class="a" style="--d:300">Black Belt Bytes</h1>
      <p class="sub a" style="--d:500">Short, focused videos built from BDM expertise and produced with AI.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="badge a" style="--d:650"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Cisco Black Belt Academy"></div>
    <p class="pres a" style="--d:850"><span>Presented by</span>Manoj Kumar · Abhishek Joshi · Anadi Uniyal · Rahul Arora</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 -->
  <section class="scene s2" aria-label="What we are solving">
    <div class="kicker a">What we are solving</div>
    <h2 class="a" style="--d:100">Learners need answers in minutes, not modules</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card p a" style="--d:300"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--blue)"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></div><b>No time for long modules</b><span>Courses take 20–40 minutes that sellers and engineers rarely have.</span></div>
      <div class="card p a" style="--d:450"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--teal)"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 7l6 6 4-4 8 8M15 17h6v-6"/></svg></div><b>Knowledge fades</b><span>Without short reinforcement, what people learn is quickly forgotten.</span></div>
      <div class="card p a" style="--d:600"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--orange)"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9z"/></svg></div><b>Need it just in time</b><span>Teams want a quick refresher right before a customer conversation.</span></div>
    </div>
