      <div class="card ph a" style="--d:400"><div class="k">PHASE 2 · UPSKILL</div><h3>BDMs learn the workflow</h3><p>Abhishek, Anadi and Rahul are trained on the same tested Descript workflow.</p><div class="cap">Capacity grows with each BDM</div></div>
