      </div>
      <div class="ask a" style="--d:850"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="width:34px;height:34px;flex:none"><path d="M4 22V4M4 4h13l-2 4 2 4H4"/></svg><div><div class="k">Next step</div><p>Approve Descript for full production. It is tested and working.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="foot"><span>Black Belt Bytes · Cisco Black Belt Academy</span>
    <div class="nav"><div class="dots" id="dots"></div>
      <button class="nbtn" id="prev" aria-label="Previous"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 6l-6 6 6 6"/></svg></button>
